From eef5b67811c393056e18de09d5a956b8530716cd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rodney Pantonial <rodneypantonial@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 11:14:05 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Stuck Check: one route check per frame;
 StaggeredCleanupVersion 2

Each Stuck Check route check plans a route from the Sim's spot (5-90 ms each in our profiles), and the nightly run did all of them in one frame. After a Sim that needed a route check, the run now sleeps one frame (only where sleeping is allowed: the nightly alarm's task or the menu interaction), after that Sim's reset decision, so the check and its decision still happen in the same frame. Sims destroyed while sleeping are skipped. The same Sims are checked with the same rules.

StaggeredCleanupVersion is now 2, so other mods can tell that both the cleanups and the stuck checks are spread.
---
 NRaasOverwatch/Overwatch.cs                        |  3 ++-
 NRaasOverwatch/OverwatchSpace/Alarms/StuckCheck.cs | 12 ++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 14 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/NRaasOverwatch/Overwatch.cs b/NRaasOverwatch/Overwatch.cs
index fea743d..810221c 100644
